<!--
  Debug builds only: lets the app reach the local Supabase stack over plain HTTP
  (adb reverse tcp:54321 tcp:54321). Release builds keep Android's default, which
  refuses cleartext traffic. See docs/PARTNER_SYNC.md §17.
-->
